DESCRIPTION:Shetland comedian Marjolein has been mixing folklore and stand-
 up for years and she's not going to stop. But she’s doing a work-in-progr
 ess show this year to have a big think. Come along and join for stories\, j
 okes and fiddle tunes. Marjolein was a finalist in Channel 4’s Sean Lock 
 Comedy Award and BBC New Comedy Awards\, and she was shortlisted for the pr
 estigious Sir Billy Connolly Spirit of Glasgow Award. ‘Phenomenal’ ****
 * (List). ‘Spellbinding’ ***** (One4Review.co.uk). ‘A fine mix of sur
 real storytelling whimsy\, winsome silliness and scatological filth’ ****
